        "nobel_worthiness": "It identified universal collective motion far from equilibrium and supplied a hydrodynamic theory for it.",
        "attribution": "Vicsek's model established the phenomenon; Toner and Tu gave the decisive continuum theory.",
        "maturity": "Its predictions and concepts have informed active-matter experiments and theory for decades.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The divide between minimal-model discovery and later hydrodynamic explanation complicates the relative credit."
